message: "If you use Aureproof, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Aureproof: an integrity layer for AI-agent evaluations"
abstract: >-
  Aureproof produces reviewable, reproducible evaluations of AI agents:
  per-task health records, signed re-scorable evidence bundles, and
  pre-registered pass/fail/inconclusive regression decisions.
